kodansha.com\/title\/10517\/episode\/349974) - United States, Japan, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, Singapore, Philippines, Thailand, Vietnam, Hong Kong, Taiwan, India, Mexico, and Brazil only.","ja":"\u59b9\u3092\u9283\u5f3e\u304b\u3089\u5b88\u3063\u305f\u3053\u3068\u3067\u610f\u8b58\u623b\u3089\u306c\u8eab\u3068\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u6700\u5f37\u306e\u6bba\u3057\u5c4b\u30fb\u5e73\u826f\u51ea\uff08\u30bf\u30a4\u30e9\u30ca\u30ae\uff09\u3002\u5f7c\u306f\u201d\u6bba\u610f\u201d\u3092\u5411\u3051\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3068\u3001\u308f\u305a\u304b\u306a\u6642\u9593\u3060\u3051\u610f\u8b58\u304c\u623b\u308b\u7279\u6b8a\u4f53\u8cea\u306e\u6301\u3061\u4e3b\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3002","vi":"Sau khi \u0111\u1ee1 h\u1ed9 em g\u00e1i m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t ph\u00e1t \u0111\u1ea1n, Taira Nagi tuy r\u1eb1ng may m\u1eafn kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ebft nh\u01b0ng gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e2y c\u1eadu \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t \u0111i \u00fd th\u1ee9c, s\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ef1c v\u1eadt. V\u1eady nh\u01b0ng mi\u1ec5n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u00e1t \u00fd v\u1edbi m\u00ecnh, Nagi s\u1ebd l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c l\u1ea5y l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u00fd th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c em g\u00e1i c\u1eadu \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p \u0111i\u1ec1u tr\u1ecb nh\u1eb1m c\u1ee9u l\u1ea5y anh trai c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.","pt-br":"Nagi Taira, o assassino mais forte, entra em coma ao proteger sua irm\u00e3 Shizuka de um tiro. Contra todas as probabilidades, ele recupera a consci\u00eancia \u2014 mas somente quando encara inten\u00e7\u00f5es assassinas! Assim come\u00e7a uma violenta jornada de reabilita\u00e7\u00e3o e batalhas contra os inimigos mais perigosos!!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"157808","ap":"sensha-isu","bl":"1273811","bw":"series\/391767","kt":"66888","mu":"mz4hwjh","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0BRJJZYTV","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2809322","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/739072","mal":"153168","raw":"https:\/\/pocket.shonenmagazine.com\/episode\/316190246907704492","engtl":"https:\/\/kodansha.us\/series\/tank-chair\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2022,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"256c8bd9-4904-4360-bf4f-508a76d67183","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sci-Fi"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b29d6a3d-1569-4e7a-8caf-7557bc92cd5d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Gore"},"description":{},"group":"content","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2022-12-20T04:11:37+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-30T13:32:28+00:00","version":43,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["vi","pt-br","en","id","es-la"],"latestUploadedChapter":"f11d5683-19d1-49e2-be24-53da8494b486"},"relationships":[{"id":"23c0c00f-e216-440c-a53f-e7e8da3c03c0","type":"author"},{"id":"23c0c00f-e216-440c-a53f-e7e8da3c03c0","type":"artist"},{"id":"d2f87ad8-b660-47a2-9665-ec28c9fbcd59","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"11","fileName":"cd83da2e-0418-43b6-a23c-3b96427b7e3c.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-09-30T13:33:04+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-30T13:33:04+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"1b72cecd-8244-4c4b-a5ff-91999f5cdcfd","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"7bb7e5ae-a784-4009-98b2-8ad4a7541548","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Diamond no Ace: Act II"},"altTitles":[{"ja-ro":"Daiya no A: Act II"},{"ru":"\u041f\u0443\u0442\u044c \u0430\u0441\u0430 - \u0410\u043a\u0442 II"},{"zh-hk":"\u947d\u77f3\u738b\u724c act\u2161"},{"en":"Ace of the Diamond: Act II"},{"ja":"\u30c0\u30a4\u30e4\u306eA\u3000act\u2161"},{"ja":"\u30c0\u30a4\u30e4\u306e\uff21\u3000\uff41\uff43\uff54\uff12"}],"description":{"en":"Eijun Sawamura had his heart set on the middle-school national baseball championships. But his team is eliminated thanks to a wild pitch thrown by Eijun himself. He\u2019s planning to go to high school with his teammates and try again next year when he\u2019s scouted by the famous Seido High School baseball team. When he goes for a campus visit, he finds himself on the receiving end of a baptism by fire! His experience forming a battery with up-and-coming catcher Miyuki rekindles his passion for baseball!!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"86569","ap":"ace-of-the-diamond-act-ii","bl":"60002617","kt":"36474","mu":"twc4qco","mal":"92559","raw":"https:\/\/pocket.shonenmagazine.com\/episode\/13932016480029113058","engtl":"https:\/\/kmanga.kodansha.com\/title\/10070"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"34","lastChapter":"308.5","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":2015,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"69964a64-2f90-4d33-beeb-f3ed2875eb4c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sports"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2018-11-15T06:18:37+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T22:12:13+00:00","version":24,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["fr","it","es-la","pt-br","en","tr","ar"],"latestUploadedChapter":"74c41a4d-a002-4763-b925-2fc843402427"},"relationships":[{"id":"0daaf3dd-e401-4cdd-9662-43bead44fd00","type":"author"},{"id":"0daaf3dd-e401-4cdd-9662-43bead44fd00","type":"artist"},{"id":"d4a703f9-4411-44c7-842c-8893ac0e4df5","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"34","fileName":"63c9b16e-e1f3-4eb2-ac6d-191e74d0a05a.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2023-07-12T14:29:32+00:00","updatedAt":"2023-07-12T14:29:32+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"00e3d40d-02c2-4bdb-bf79-18f6743058f0","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"5f69014d-a891-4d6c-84cb-78cefcf4154d","type":"manga","related":"side_story"},{"id":"60879eb7-3845-4dff-b86d-5a612108053b","type":"manga","related":"prequel"},{"id":"9eaf0db5-b3d9-4c04-b98d-2f64fb178dd6","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"af4ddae5-38d6-4a2c-a909-c17655109938","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"eec7f9c5-4ce3-4094-8a50-898e2811b9fc","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"}]},{"id":"59b36734-f2d6-46d7-97c0-06cfd2380852","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Toukyou \u534d Revengers"},"altTitles":[{"ru":"\u0422\u043e\u043a\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u043c\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0438"},{"zh":"\u4e1c\u4eac\u534d\u590d\u4ec7\u8005"},{"ja":"\u6771\u4eac\u534d\u30ea\u30d9\u30f3\u30b8\u30e3\u30fc\u30ba"},{"zh-hk":"\u6771\u4eac\u534d\u5fa9\u4ec7\u8005"},{"tr":"Tokyo \u0130ntikamc\u0131lar\u0131"},{"ja-ro":"Toukyou Manji Revengers"},{"en":"Tokyo Revengers"}],"description":{"en":"Watching the news, Takemichi Hanagaki learns that his girlfriend from way back in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, has died. The only girlfriend he ever had was just killed by a villainous group known as the Tokyo Manji Gang. He lives in a crappy apartment with thin walls, and his six-years-younger boss treats him like an idiot. Plus, he\u2019s a complete and total virgin\u2026 At the height of his rock-bottom life, he suddenly time-leaps 12 years back to his middle school days!! To save Hinata, and change the life he spent running away, hopeless part-timer Takemichi must aim for the top of Kanto\u2019s most sinister delinquent gang!!\n\n*Source: Kodansha Comics, Vol. 1*\n\n---\n\n**Notes:**\n- The original Japanese title contains the manji symbol, so it will not be removed from the title on MangaDex.\n- Addendum on the \"Manji\" for those uninformed. From Seven Seas' Omnibus Edition:\n  *\"In East Asia the manji (\u534d) is an ancient religious symbol of power and good fortune for many different countries and religions around the world, including Buddhism, Hinduism, Jainism, and a number of Indo-European and Native American religions as well.\"* \n*\"The specific meaning of the symbol varies by nation and religion, and also by the position of the \"arms\" of the cross--whether they face left or right, or whether the cross is tilted or straight.\"* \n*\"In the 1930s, the swastika symbol--a clockwise, tilted cross--was adopted by the Nazi Political Party in Germany, and gained a negative reputation as a symbol of hatred in the modern world.\"*\n*\"The manji used by the Tokyo Manji Gang as their emblem is intended to be the ancient Buddhist symbol, as evidenced by the appearance of its counterclockwise, straight arms...\"*\n\n---\n\n**Links:**\n- [Official English Translation (Seven Seas)](https:\/\/sevenseasentertainment.com\/series\/tokyo-revengers-omnibus)\n- [Official English Translation (Kodansha USA)](https:\/\/kodansha.us\/series\/tokyo-revengers)","tl":"Si Takemichi ay isang 26-taong-gulang na walang trabahong birhen na nalaman na ang babaeng naka-date niya sa middle school, ang tanging babaeng naka-date niya, ay namatay. Pagkatapos, pagkatapos ng isang aksidente nahanap niya ang kanyang sarili sa isang paglukso ng oras pabalik sa kanyang mga taon sa middle school. Nangako siyang babaguhin ang kinabukasan at iligtas ang babae, at para magawa iyon, layunin niyang umangat sa pinaka-brutal na delingkwenteng gang sa rehiyon ng Kanto.","tr":"Takemichi, ortaokulda \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131, \u015fimdiye kadar \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131 tek k\u0131z\u0131n \u00f6ld\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fc \u00f6\u011frenen i\u015fsiz bir bakirdir. Daha sonra bir kazan\u0131n ard\u0131ndan kendini ortaokul y\u0131llar\u0131na geri d\u00f6nen bir zamanda bulur. Gelece\u011fi de\u011fi\u015ftirmeye ve k\u0131z\u0131 kurtarmaya yemin eder ve bunu yapmak i\u00e7in Kantou b\u00f6lgesinin en ac\u0131mas\u0131z su\u00e7lu \u00e7etesinin tepesine \u00e7\u0131kmay\u0131 hedefler.\r\n\r\n2020 y\u0131l\u0131nda en iyi shounen dal\u0131nda 44. Kodansha Manga \u00d6d\u00fcl\u00fc'n\u00fc kazanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.","pt-br":"Takemichi \u00e9 um virgem desempregado de 26 anos que descobre que a garota que ele namorou durante o ensino m\u00e9dio - a \u00fanica que ele j\u00e1 namorou - morreu. Ent\u00e3o, ap\u00f3s um acidente ele se encontra de volta ao passado, durante seus anos de ensino m\u00e9dio. Ele promete mudar o futuro e salvar a garota, e para isso, ele planeja subir at\u00e9 o topo da gangue de delinquentes mais brutal da regi\u00e3o de Kantou."},"isLocked":true,"links":{"al":"102988","ap":"tokyo-revengers","kt":"40278","mu":"aev98v4","mal":"104565","raw":"https:\/\/pocket.shonenmagazine.com\/episode\/13932016480029113171","engtl":"https:\/\/kmanga.kodansha.com\/title\/10075"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"31","lastChapter":"278","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":2017,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"07251805-a27e-4d59-b488-f0bfbec15168","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Thriller"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"0a39b5a1-b235-4886-a747-1d05d216532d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Award Winning"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"292e862b-2d17-4062-90a2-0356caa4ae27