a Up wo Hajimeta you desu~"},{"en":"Sasaki and Peeps: That Time I Got Dragged into a Psychic Battle in Modern Times While Trying to Enjoy a Relaxing Life in Another World ~Looks Like Magical Girls Are On Deck~"},{"en":"Sasaki and P-chan"},{"zh-hk":"\u4f50\u4f50\u6728\u8207\u5c0f\u55f6 \u60f3\u5728\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u4eab\u53d7\u60a0\u54c9\u751f\u6d3b\uff0c\u537b\u5728\u73fe\u4ee3\u88ab\u6372\u5165\u7570\u80fd\u6230\u9b25 \uff5e\u9b54\u6cd5\u5c11\u5973\u597d\u50cf\u958b\u59cb\u71b1\u8eab\u4e86\uff5e"},{"vi":"Sasaki v\u00e0 Pii-chan: Chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 t\u00f4i b\u1ecb cu\u1ed1n v\u00e0o tr\u1eadn chi\u1ebfn D\u1ecb n\u0103ng \u1edf th\u1eddi hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i trong khi c\u1ed1 g\u1eafng t\u1eadn h\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1ed1i s\u1ed1ng ch\u1eadm r\u00e3i \u1edf d\u1ecb gi\u1edbi ~Xem ra Ma ph\u00e1p Thi\u1ebfu n\u1eef c\u0169ng xu\u1ea5t tr\u1eadn~"}],"description":{"en":"The cute bird he bought from the pet store was actually a distinguished sage who reincarnated from another world. Bestowed the opportunity to cross between worlds and immense magical power, he decides to use it to live a comfortable life, selling things from his world, training his magic, and eating delicious food. However, he discovers beings with special abilities in present-day Japan. A story where a corporate slave, who was at a deadlock in his career, gets wrapped up in a battle of special powers and cuts it close with his magic as he travels to and from the other world and present-day Japan. Magical girl included.\n\n*Source: Mangaupdates*","ja":"\u30da\u30c3\u30c8\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8cfc\u5165\u3057\u305f\u6587\u9ce5\u306e\u6b63\u4f53\u306f\u2026\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u8ee2\u751f\u3057\u305f\u8ce2\u8005\u69d8\uff01\uff1f\u56db\u5341\u8def\u306e\u793e\u755c\u30fb\u4f50\u3005\u6728\u3068\u6587\u9ce5\uff08\u8ee2\u751f\u8ce2\u8005\u69d8\uff09\u306e\u51fa\u4f1a\u3044\u304c\u3001\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u5909\u3048\u308b\uff01\u2026\u304b\u3082\u3057\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002","vi":"Sasaki, v\u1ed1n l\u00e0 nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng, quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh nh\u1eadn nu\u00f4i m\u1ed9t ch\u00fa chim, nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ng\u1edd ch\u00fa chim l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 hi\u1ec1n gi\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi kh\u00e1c. C\u00f9ng nhau, h\u1ecd b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u con \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng \nl\u00e0m \u0103n th\u00f4ng qua hai th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, nh\u1eb1m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng b\u00ecnh y\u00ean l\u00e2u d\u00e0i. Tuy nhi\u00ean, Sasaki s\u1edbm ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ed1i m\u1eb7t cu\u1ed9c chi\u1ebfn gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c th\u1ebf l\u1ef1c \u1edf th\u1eddi hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, \u0111i k\u00e8m l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng r\u1eafc r\u1ed1i t\u1ea1i d\u1ecb gi\u1edbi. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u1ecb gi\u1edbi, d\u1ecb n\u0103ng gi\u1ea3, ma ph\u00e1p thi\u1ebfu n\u1eef, v\u00e0\u2026 m\u1ed9t b\u00e9 n\u1eef sinh trung h\u1ecdc\u2026\u2026? Li\u1ec7u Sasaki c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c mong \u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh kh\u00f4ng?"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"134499","ap":"sasaki-and-peeps-that-time-i-got-dragged-into-a-psychic-battle-in-modern-times-while-trying-to-enjoy-a-relaxing-life-in-another-world-looks-like-magical-girls-are-on-deck","bl":"20034458","bw":"series\/304686","kt":"64022","mu":"we8my2x","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0B4N3235K","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/643840\/","mal":"134974","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/detail\/KC_000265_S"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2021,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"81c836c9-914a-4eca-981a-560dad66