e8458563","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Hotel Inhumans"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30db\u30c6\u30eb\u30fb\u30a4\u30f3\u30d2\u30e5\u30fc\u30de\u30f3\u30ba"},{"en":"Hotel in Humans"},{"pt-br":"Hotel Desumano"}],"description":{"en":"The most exquisite hotels in the world have certain standards: the finest food, the most sublime comfort, captivating entertainment, the latest weapons, reliable identity fabrication, and untraceable corpse disposal. The name of this place where the people who have \"forgotten their humanity\" visit is \"Hotel In Humans.\" The hitmen guests are welcomed by the concierges who never say \"no.\"","ja":"\u305d\u306e\u30db\u30c6\u30eb\u306e\u2026\u300c\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306f\u6bba\u3057\u5c4b\u69d8\u300d\n\n\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u30db\u30c6\u30eb\u306b\u306f\u6761\u4ef6\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3002\u300c\u6975\u4e0a\u306e\u98df\u4e8b\u300d\u3001\u300c\u81f3\u9ad8\u306e\u7652\u3084\u3057\u300d\u3001\u300c\u9b45\u60d1\u306e\u5a2f\u697d\u300d\u2026\n\n\u305d\u3057\u3066\u3001\u201c\u6700\u65b0\u306e\u6b66\u5668\u624b\u914d\u201d\u3001\u201c\u5b89\u5fc3\u306e\u8eab\u5143\u8a50\u79f0\u201d\u3001\u201c\u5b8c\u74a7\u306a\u6b7b\u4f53\u51e6\u7406\u201d\u2015\u2015\uff01\uff1f\u305d\u306e\u30db\u30c6\u30eb\u306e\u2026\u300c\u304a\u5ba2\u69d8\u306f\u6bba\u3057\u5c4b\u69d8\u300d\u3002\u6b7b\u306e\u5883\u754c\u7dda\u3067\u3001\u6c7a\u3057\u3066\u300eNO\u3068\u544a\u3052\u306a\u3044\u300f\u30b3\u30f3\u30b7\u30a7\u30eb\u30b8\u30e5\u304c\u5fdc\u3048\u308b\u6bba\u3057\u5c4b\u305f\u3061\u306e\u9858\u3044\u3068\u306f\u2015\u2015","pt-br":"Os hot\u00e9is mais requintados do mundo t\u00eam certos padr\u00f5es: As melhores comidas, o conforto mais sublime, entretenimento cativante, e, al\u00e9m disso, as armas mais recentes, fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o confi\u00e1vel de identidade e descarte de cad\u00e1veres n\u00e3o rastre\u00e1vel. O nome desse lugar onde as pessoas que o visitam \"esqueceram sua humanidade\", chama-se \"Hotel In Humans\" (Hotel Desumano)"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"135427","ap":"hotel-inhumans","bw":"series\/321208\/list","kt":"60562","mu":"a02p90l","mal":"139086","raw":"https:\/\/www.sunday-webry.com\/detail.php?title_id=5728"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"12","lastChapter":"59","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":2021,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"5ca48985-9a9d-4bd8-be29-80dc0303db72","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Crime"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"85daba54-a71c-4554-8a28-9901a8b0afad","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mafia"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2021-10-10T10:24:54+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-11-23T17:16:21+00:00","version":20,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["vi","en","pt-br"],"latestUploadedChapter":"f1367841-b91f-4147-8408-01336168dfcc"},"relationships":[{"id":"dd146b69-ae24-4ffb-a74d-0fc961429f8a","type":"author"},{"id":"dd146b69-ae24-4ffb-a74d-0fc961429f8a","type":"artist"},{"id":"0d72d7a7-a1ad-47be-b325-ed9401fe7786","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"12","fileName":"c3f87a93-96ac-4c68-9b43-b90c863d7b8b.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2025-09-16T21:04:08+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-09-16T21:04:08+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"416fcfbb-0f5c-40e2-9a4f-5dca25a33514","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"ce330ce2-47bb-414f-a887-d4c07948a2a5","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Keroro Gunsou"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30b1\u30ed\u30ed\u8ecd\u66f9"},{"de":"Sgt. Frog"},{"fr":"Sergent Keroro"},{"sv":"Keroro: Grodan Fr\u00e5n Rymden"},{"id":"Sersan Keroro"},{"vi":"Qu\u00e2n \u0110o\u00e0n \u1ebech Xanh"},{"es":"KERORO"},{"ko":"\uac1c\uad6c\ub9ac \ud558\uc0ac \ucf00\ub85c\ub85c"},{"zh":"KERORO\u8ecd\u66f9"},{"it":"KERORO"},{"ms":"Keroro Gunso"},{"en":"Sgt. Frog"}],"description":{"en":"Sergeant Keroro is the Captain of the Space Invasion Forces Special Advance Team of the 58th Planet of the Gamma Storm Cloud System, sent to the planet Pokopen (aka Earth) to collect intelligence for his planet's invasion force. He is also a frog. After his ship crash-lands in the planet earth, he takes shelter in the Hinata household, but the two kids, Fuyuki and Natsume, find him and take away his alien weapons. When his people discover that the Pokopenians are aware of him, Keroro is abandoned - left to fend for himself in this hostile world. But he's not alone - four other pre-invasion agents were are also lurking on Earth.  \n  \nIn 2005, Sgt. Frog received the 50th Shogakukan Manga Award for children's manga.\n\n\n---\nOfficial Release:\n- Indonesian release by Elex Media (including Sersan Keroro Green, Red, Pink, and Black)"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"30390","ap":"sgt-frog","bw":"series\/45\/list","kt":"885","mu":"a5sqcjh","mal":"390","engtl":"https:\/\/www.viz.com\/sgt-frog"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":1999,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"0a39b5a1-b235-4886-a747-1d05d216532d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Award Winning"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"256c8bd9-4904-4360-bf4f-508a76d67183","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sci-Fi"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"39730448-9a5f-48a2-85b0-a70db87b1233","type":"tag","attribute