rtist"},{"id":"6dde7717-3323-4fbd-80ac-c9f7b1b9ad0b","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"2","fileName":"2af0c6f7-cd3d-4c59-afee-a8ff471e0561.jpg","locale":"ko","createdAt":"2021-10-23T02:20:11+00:00","updatedAt":"2021-10-23T02:20:12+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"1e96501d-fe9e-412c-a949-e8b961351efc","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"6ef19044-70d3-4e87-994b-4cc07ccd0810","type":"manga","related":"alternate_version"}]},{"id":"54e260dc-5519-41c3-853c-d5f2a252b10f","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Mahou Shoujo Ikusei Keikaku: Restart"},"altTitles":[{"en":"Magical Girl Raising Project: Restart"},{"ja":"\u9b54\u6cd5\u5c11\u5973\u80b2\u6210\u8a08\u753brestart"},{"pt-br":"Projeto de Treinamento de Garota M\u00e1gica: Rein\u00edcio"}],"description":{"en":"16 Magical Girls have been chosen to participate in the Magical Girl Raising Project by an unknown person and this time, there's prize money involved. Every three days, their Magical Phones will pull them into an RPG-like simulation where they have to clear the game to get out!","pt-br":"16 Garotas M\u00e1gicas foram escolhidas para participar do \"Projeto de Treinamento de Garota M\u00e1gica\" por uma pessoa desconhecida e, dessa vez, h\u00e1 um pr\u00eamio em dinheiro envolvido. A cada tr\u00eas dias, seus Celulares M\u00e1gicos as levar\u00e3o para uma simula\u00e7\u00e3o estilo RPG, onde elas ter\u00e3o que terminar o jogo para sair!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"109279","ap":"magical-girl-raising-project-restart","kt":"mahou-shoujo-ikusei-keikaku-restart","mu":"acvuhev","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/4041047919","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-1986007","mal":"102373","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/contents\/detail\/KDCW_KS04000026010000_68\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2016,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"07251805-a27e-4d59-b488-f0bfbec15168","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Thriller"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"81c836c9-914a-4eca-981a-560dad663e73","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magical Girls"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2020-04-17T15:14:04+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-16T14:32:07+00:00","version":9,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","pt-br"],"latestUploadedChapter":"bf6cb38a-d023-4c5e-b2f1-c189598df125"},"relationships":[{"id":"6c22d847-ff99-4d83-a49f-7cc5e2ede896","type":"author"},{"id":"604a5c06-2173-41ce-b2a9-2f7f282cba22","type":"artist"},{"id":"89bc69ba-7ddb-4f7e-9193-4900d4633692","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":null,"fileName":"b0c0bb0f-f27a-4ab3-b6ef-c5ab39b00ac7.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2021-05-24T17:52:45+00:00","updatedAt":"2021-05-24T17:52:45+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"467728dd-594c-47f9-87fc-194cfbef3b55","type":"manga","related":"prequel"},{"id":"921fb112-54c2-457f-8e7b-3a357ee391cc","type":"manga","related":"alternate_story"}]},{"id":"d41bebac-1fd3-45dd-80f4-c371db540a2a","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Ranma 1\/2"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u3089\u3093\u307e1\/2"},{"ja-ro":"Ranma \u00bd"},{"th":"\u0e23\u0e31\u0e19\u0e21\u0e48\u0e32 \u00bd \u0e44\u0e2d\u0e49\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e38\u0e48\u0e21\u0e01\u0e31\u0e07\u0e1f\u0e39"},{"ar":"\u0631\u0627\u0646\u0645\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0635\u0641"},{"ru":"\u0420\u0430\u043d\u043c\u0430 \u00bd"},{"sv":"Ranma en halv"},{"zh":"\u4e82\u99ac\u00bd"},{"zh-ro":"Lu\u00e0n m\u01ce \u00bd"},{"ko":"\ub780\ub9c8 \u00bd"},{"ko-ro":"lanma \u00bd"},{"es":"Ranma un-medio"},{"es-la":"Ranma y medio"},{"vi":"M\u1ed9t n\u1eeda Ranma"},{"it":"Ranma un-mezzo"},{"it":"Ranma mezzo"},{"pt":"Ranma Meio"},{"no":"Ranma en og en halv"},{"fa":"\u0631\u0627\u0646\u0645\u0627 \u06f1\/\u06f2"},{"ms":"Ranma setengah"},{"zh-hk":"\u4e82\u99ac\u00bd"},{"da":"Ranma\u00bd"}],"description":{"en":"(from ebookjapan):\n\nSoun was disappointed to find that Ranma was a girl. However, when Ranma got out of the bath, he turned into a boy and the panda turned into Ranma's father, Genma. The two had fallen into a fountain during their training in China, a fountain that turned them into a woman and panda respectively when they touched the water. \n\nThe Tendo family is initially in turmoil, including Akane, who has become a prospective bride, as they face the troublesome duo who go back and forth between man and woman, human and panda, although they can be restored to their original state if they are bathed in hot water. \n\nThis is the first volume of a new edition of the popular manga.\n\n\n---\nOfficial Release:\n- English release by [Viz Media](https:\/\/www.viz.com\/ranma-1-2)\n- Indonesian release by Elex Media","pt-br":"Ranma Saotome foi treinado desde a inf\u00e2ncia at\u00e9 aos 16 anos. \u00c9 estudante de artes marciais que, junto ao pai, Genma Saotome, fez uma jornada de treinamento nas Montanhas Bayan Har Shan, na Prov\u00edncia de Qinghai, na China. Ali h\u00e1 o campo de treinamento chamado Jusenkyo onde existem diversas fontes amaldi\u00e7oadas. Cada uma delas est\u00e1 associada \u00e0 hist\u00f3ria de algu\u00e9m que morreu afogado h\u00e1 centenas ou milhares de anos e quem cair em uma delas transforma-se no ser que morreu afogado nela, seja ele humano ou n\u00e3o.  No meio do treinamento, Ranma e seu pai caem, cada um em uma fonte diferente, e acabam amaldi\u00e7oados. Depois desse incidente, toda vez que Ranma se molha com \u00e1gua fria, transforma-se em uma bela garota, enquanto seu pai em um enorme panda. Somente o banho com \u00e1gua quente pode reverter os personagens \u00e0 sua forma original, ainda que temporariamente."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"30023","ap":"ranma-12","kt":"62","mu":"aw9hxcj","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/-\/en\/dp\/B074CH15KG\/","mal":"23","engtl":"https:\/\/www.viz.com\/ranma-1-2"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"38","lastChapter":"407","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":1987,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"799c202e-7daa-44eb-9cf7-8a3c0441531e","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Martial Arts"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"da2d50ca-3018-4cc0-ac7a-6b7d472a29ea","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Delinquents"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"eabc5b4c-6aff-42f3-b657-3e90cbd00b75","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Supernatural"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2018-03-05T22:04:31+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-04-03T22:20:48+00:00","version":25,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["ar","vi","pt-br","en","bg","es-la","my","fi"],"latestUploadedChapter":"25bf33fe-87d7-4d94-b1e3-e7ce54bc8284"},"relationships":[{"id":"3749c8e1-a4d3-4d98-958b-4fa575d7f6b7","type":"author"},{"id":"3749c8e1-a4d3-4d98-958b-4fa575d7f6b7","type":"artist"},{"id":"f9f96836-50b7-468b-ae66-4cc318958d1a","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"Format: Tankoubon\r\nImprint: Shounen Sunday Comics\r\nPublisher: Shogakukan\r\nYear: 1988","volume":"37","fileName":"a8e0e761-b213-46b5-8aed-f20dce316190.png","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2024-07-18T02:26:13+00:00","updatedAt":"2024-07-18T02:26:13+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"13531ca8-fb8e-4d3a-9104-5bdd052d22e8","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"74ad2ce9-a1c0-49b1-9732-a49b05791639","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"856cf0aa-dd49-496c-b6cd-365a7efcff4d","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"bbe5d523-554a-4c2b-a14e-bdac083e03a1","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"c126ac97-35f6-46fe-b893-57f5cb87a328","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"}]},{"id":"46663ee4-068c-41d8-a7b5-e4c6e5310c0d","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"zh-ro":"D\u00e0w\u00e1ng R\u00e1om\u00ecng"},"altTitles":[{"en":"Spare Me, Great Lord!"},{"zh":"\u5927\u738b\u9976\u547d"},{"vi":"\u0110\u1ea1i V\u01b0\u01a1ng Tha M\u1ea1ng"},{"en":"SMGL"}],"description":{"en":"After the revivification and return of the spirit energy, men and women did their best to capture every strands of spirit energy and train, except Lu Shu, with his Negative Emotion System, he becomes stronger by taunting others! He only wanted to protect his younger sister, but the change of an era in unavoidable, then all he could do was\u2026 to taunt others in passing, and become the strongest! Then, are you ready? Here comes Lu Shu, 'The Great Demon King'~  \n\n\n---\n\nAlt. Official English (WeComics)  \nAlt. Official English (MangaToon)"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"120288","ap":"spare-me-great-lord","kt":"56330","mu":"9w1fe81","mal":"145699","raw":"https:\/\/ac.qq.com\/Comic\/comicInfo\/id\/645654"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"zh","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"949","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"completed","year":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3e2b8dae-350e-4ab8-a8ce-016e844b9f0d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Long Strip"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e197df38-d0e7-43b5-9b09-2842d0c326dd","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Web Comic"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ee968100-4191-4968-93d3-f82d72be7e46","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mystery"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f5ba408b-0e7a-484d-8d49-4e9125ac96de","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Full Color"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2020-04-28T17:11:12+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-12-25T01:47:03+00:00","version":11,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","id","es-la","ru"],"latestUploadedChapter":"42218aaa-d452-4a5a-844b-38fd11fdf9ec"},"relationships":[{"id":"0b04cd65-3b47-4d76-b751-3be16c077b95","type":"author"},{"id":"530117d1-7d54-425d-ab24-691e0f0a85e1","type":"author"},{"id":"0b04cd65-3b47-4d76-b751-3be16c077b95","type":"artist"},{"id":"4714bbca-e353-48b2-a4ef-4e539fb2a8ce","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"2","fileName":"8eaa3211-971d-4b94-aaf3-e552a8f45892.jpg","locale":"zh","createdAt":"2024-02-17T15:37:21+00:00","updatedAt":"2024-02-17T15:37:21+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"baa96f52-19a3-4fe1-8000-1019a083c088","type":"manga","related":"same_franchise"}]},{"id":"782211b2-44ca-44ae-89f2-8a1160221b96","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Tensei Goblin dakedo Shitsumon Aru?"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u8ee2\u751f\u30b4\u30d6\u30ea\u30f3\u3060\u3051\u3069\u8cea\u554f\u3042\u308b\uff1f"},{"ko":"\uc804\uc0dd \uace0\ube14\ub9b0\uc778\ub370 \uc9c8\ubb38 \uc788\uc5b4?"},{"zh":"\u8f6c\u4e16\u54e5\u5e03\u6797\u4e50\u961f\u4f60\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u95ee\u9898\u5417?"},{"zh-hk":"\u8f49\u4e16\u54e5\u5e03\u6797\u6a02\u968a\u4f60\u6709\u4ec0\u9ebd\u554f\u984c\u55ce?"},{"es":"Soy un goblin reencarnado, \u00bfalguna otra pregunta?"},{"en":"So What\u2019s Wrong with Getting Reborn as a Goblin?"}],"description":{"en":"An ordinary office worker should have died in a traffic accident, but when he awoke he became a goblin. Goblins have a lifespan of only seven days. However, the hero who has been given the skill \"Human 80 years\" takes advantage of his longevity and takes over the skills of many goblins and even the demon king who is on the verge of destined life, and stands out in a different world. Weakest Race x Strongest Skill = The strongest fantasy is incomparable!","es":"Un empleado de oficina com\u00fan deber\u00eda haber muerto en un accidente de tr\u00e1nsito, pero cuando despert\u00f3 se convirti\u00f3 en un Goblin. Sin embargo, el protagonista al que se le ha dado la habilidad \"Humano 80 a\u00f1os\" aprovecha al m\u00e1ximo su longevidad, se hace cargo de las habilidades de muchos duendes, e incluso del demonio que est\u00e1 al borde de la vida destinada, y se destaca en un mundo diferente. Raza m\u00e1s d\u00e9bil x Habilidad m\u00e1s fuerte = \u00a1La fantas\u00eda de Musou m\u00e1s fuerte!","ja":"\u9762\u5012\u898b\u304c\u3088\u304f\u3001\u305d\u308c\u3086\u3048\u306b\u8ca7\u4e4f\u304f\u3058\u3092\u5f15\u304d\u304c\u3061\u306a\u30b5\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u30de\u30f3\u30fb\u516b\u795e\u5f70\u306f\u4f11\u65e5\u51fa\u52e4\u306e\u5e30\u5b85\u9014\u4e2d\u3001\u8eca\u9053\u306b\u98db\u3073\u51fa\u3057\u305f\u5b50\u4f9b\u3092\u5e87\u3063\u3066\u7d76\u547d\u3057\u305f\u2026\u306f\u305a\u3060\u3063\u305f\u304c\u3001\u76ee\u3092\u899a\u307e\u3059\u3068\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u3067\u7570\u7a2e\u65cf\u201c\u30b4\u30d6\u30ea\u30f3\u201d\u306b\u8ee2\u751f\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002\u30b4\u30d6\u30ea\u30f3\u306e\u5bff\u547d\u306f\u308f\u305a\u304b7\u65e5\u3002\u3057\u304b\u3057\u3001\u8ee2\u751f\u6642\u306b\u4e0e\u3048\u3089\u308c\u305f\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3010\u4eba\u959380\u5e74\u3011\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u9577\u5bff\u3092\u5f97\u305f\u30a2\u30ad\u30e9\u306f\u3001\u5148\u7acb\u3063\u3066\u3044\u304f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u30b4\u30d6\u30ea\u30f3\u304b\u3089\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u7d99\u304e\u3001\u66f4\u306b\u306f\u7015\u6b7b\u306e\u9b54\u738b\u304b\u3089\u6700\u5f37\u306e\u56fa\u6709\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3010\u5f31\u8089\u5f37\u98df\u3011\u3092\u7d99\u627f\u3057\u3001\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u3067\u982d\u89d2\u3092\u73fe\u3057\u3066\u3044\u304f\u2015\u2015!!"},"isLocked":false,"li